</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Almighty Son, incarnate Word,</l><l>Our Prophet, Priest, Redeemer, Lord,</l><l>Before Thy throne we sinners bend;</l><l>To us Thy saving grace extend.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Eternal Spirit, by whose breath</l><l>The soul is raised from sin and death,</l><l>Before Thy throne we sinners bend;</l><l>To us Thy quickening power extend.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thrice holy—Father, Spirit, Son;</l><l>Mysterious Godhead, Three in One,</l><l>Before Thy throne we sinners bend;</l><l>Grace, pardon, life to us extend.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
